        <mxCell id="OJzDrqCLXjhtIuUQVfKB-41" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;div align=&quot;justify&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;ext&lt;/i&gt; fields&lt;/b&gt;: these are variables belonging to the protocol class. Since the monitors extend the protocol class, they can have access to the these variables&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
